  "factor_name": "VIX-Conditioned Downside-Adjusted Trend",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "lag1(rank((log(close_t/close_t-20))/(sqrt(20)*downside_std_30)) - 0.5) in normal VIX regime; lag1(0.55*trend_rank + 0.45*rank(-(log(close_t/close_t-5))) - 0.5) when VIX_t > VIX_t-5",
    "description": "Cross-sectional downside-volatility-adjusted 20-session momentum in normal volatility conditions, blended with a short-term reversal component when the observation-only VIX has risen over five sessions. The complete signal is lagged one session to avoid look-ahead. VIX is used only as a macro observation and is not tradable."
  },
